<title>ROMANIA: June Romanian producer prices rise 3.6 percent.</title>
<headline>June Romanian producer prices rise 3.6 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Producer prices in Romanian industry rose 3.6 percent in June and 40.7 percent year-on-year, National Statistics Board data showed.</p>
<p> ROMANIAN PRODUCER PRICES	  JUNE     MAY	JUNE 95</p>
<p>  mth/mth change			+3.6     +3.7	+3.7</p>
<p>  extraction industry		+0.1     +0.2	+4.2</p>
<p>  processing industry		+4.2     +4.4	+2.9</p>
<p>  energy and gas industry	  +0.2     +0.0	+9.7</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
